---

<section id="reception">
	<h2>Vielse</h2>

	<div class="content-container">
		<div class="info-text">
			<p>
				Vi feirer vielsen utendørs i bakhagen vår, <strong>Dælenenggata 21-23, 0567 Oslo</strong>.
				Kom gjerne i god tid før seremonien starter kl. 13:00.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="weather-frame">
			<iframe
				src="https://www.yr.no/nb/innhold/2-11844416/table.html"
				title="Værvarsel"
				class="weather-iframe"></iframe>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	#reception {
		min-height: 100vh;
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 800px;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
		box-sizing: border-box;
	}

	h2 {
		font-family: 'Brittany', cursive;
		font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
		margin: 0 0 2rem;
	}

	.content-container {
		background-color: #fdfbf0;
		border-radius: 0.5rem;
		padding: 2rem;
		box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
		border: 2px solid #d5d0a8;
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 750px;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 2rem;
		box-sizing: border-box;
	}

	.info-text {
		text-align: left;
		font-family: 'Lora Variable', serif;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
	}

	.weather-frame {
		width: 100%;
		border-radius: 4px;
		overflow: hidden;
		background-color: #fdfbf0;
		border: 1px solid #d5d0a8;
		box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.weather-frame {
			overflow-x: auto;
			overflow-y: hidden;
			-webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
			scroll-behavior: smooth;
		}
	}

	.weather-iframe {
		width: 100%;
		height: 520px;
		border: none;
		display: block;
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.content-container {
			padding: 1.5rem;
		}

		.weather-iframe {
			height: 550px;
			min-width: 600px;
		}
	}
</style>
